---
// The three differentiator pillars.
---
<section class="band band--soft" aria-labelledby="pillars-h">
  <div class="band__inner">
    <div class="intro reveal">
      <h2 id="pillars-h" class="h2">Built for how your household really runs.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Three things Kindred does that make the week lighter — not another calendar to keep up with.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3">
      <article class="fcard reveal" style="--accent: var(--color-primary); --accent-wash: var(--color-primary-wash)">
        <div class="fcard__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="3"/><path d="M3 9h18M8 2v4M16 2v4M12 13v4M10 15h4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="fcard__title">Capture the meal, not the form.</h3>
        <p class="fcard__body">Tap a slot, pick the meal, done. No clock-time field, no required tags — the form only opens up when you want it to.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="fcard reveal" style="--accent: var(--color-teal-deep); --accent-wash: var(--color-teal-wash)">
        <div class="fcard__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l1.7 4.8L18.5 8.5 13.7 10.2 12 15l-1.7-4.8L5.5 8.5l4.8-1.7z"/><path d="M18.5 13l.9 2.4 2.4.9-2.4.9-.9 2.4-.9-2.4-2.4-.9 2.4-.9z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="fcard__eyebrow">✨ AI</span>
        <h3 class="fcard__title">Plan next week in 30 seconds.</h3>
        <p class="fcard__body">Hit Plan Next Week and Kindred drafts a week from what’s in your stock and what your household actually eats. Don’t like a draft? The AI credit comes straight back.</p>
        <div><span class="ktag ktag--teal">Credit back on a miss</span></div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcard reveal" style="--accent: var(--color-coral-deep); --accent-wash: var(--color-coral-wash)">
        <div class="fcard__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1.6"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1.6"/><path d="M2 3h3l2.3 12.2a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h7.6a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.6L21.5 8H6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="fcard__title">Your stock, your shop, in sync.</h3>
        <p class="fcard__body">Didn’t grab something this trip? It stays on your list until you do — and next week’s plan only asks for what you’re still missing. Add a recipe and the shopping list builds itself from what’s not already in your stock.</p>
        <div><span class="ktag ktag--coral">Nothing gets lost</span></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
